      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Availability cube — current face\n\nOne row per `(reservable_id, target_date)`, read straight from **`availability_cell`** — the cube's *now* face, upserted on every poll. `last_observed_at` bumps every tick; `status` / `last_changed_at` advance only on an edge (status change). The append-only transition history lives in `availability_snapshot`; drill into it from the **[Watch drill-down](/d/reservable-watch-drill/reservable-watch-drill)**.\n\nEach row is a site + night colored by current `status`. Click a cell's **Create Slack alert** action to watch that site+night and get pinged in Slack when it flips to bookable. `past` = the date has elapsed and the cube stopped recording.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
